STATE PLANE EAST FIPZONE 4901 WY E.
TO CONVERT TO STATE PLANE COORDINATES ADD 100,000 FT TO THE NORTHING
AND 500,000 FT TO THE EASTING AND MULTIPLY BY A PROJECT SCALE FACTOR OF
0.99966591765.
